WEBVTT

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.781
In the beginning, God burned
the dead leaves of the earth.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.622
Into their ashes
he poured His own blood.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.300
And lo, the ashes hardened
and became the first man.

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:14.034
100 days later, a great storm
raged and smashed the body apart.

00:01:19.146 --> 00:01:23.310
And next, God gathered together
the flesh of the beasts of...

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:26.944
...the earth, and to this
added one of his own bones.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:36.090
And lo, it became
the second man.

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:38.961
And this new body rotted
in the heat of the sun...

00:01:39.066 --> 00:01:41.899
...and the earth it sank
into became as wormwood.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.373
And so God burned
the poisoned ground...

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:54.243
...and from it
produced a new seed.

00:01:54.348 --> 00:01:56.646
And He stilled the
motion of the earth...

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.015
...and fertilized the
seed with His own heart.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.179
And we are that seed!

00:02:10.764 --> 00:02:12.459
Who's there?

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.134
I know you're here.

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:21.636
Will you tell me your names?
Mine's Mel.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:26.241
<i>I'm 'l ui'.
I'm Ran'. I'm M“!</i>

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.815
Quiet!
Knock it off!

00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:32.816
My name's Rocco.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:38.291
They told me to bring you to
the church when you woke up.

00:02:38.392 --> 00:02:40.156
I see.

00:02:42.563 --> 00:02:46.158
Know then that we
are God's chosen!

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:52.162
Never forget our mission
to build the new world!

00:02:57.444 --> 00:03:02.280
Pray for true peace and
happiness for this city.

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.609
Ah, you've awakened.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:11.719
"God's messenger?"
Me?

00:03:11.825 --> 00:03:15.386
Of course.
Before the Endtimes...

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:18.362
...a messenger is sent
by God as a warning.

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:20.797
That messenger is you.

00:03:21.168 --> 00:03:24.627
Your falling into this room
was proof enough of this.

00:03:25.439 --> 00:03:29.467
Now, please tell me.
What were God's words to you'?

00:03:30.844 --> 00:03:32.710
"God's words?"

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:38.451
Yes. You heard His voice,
and saw Him with your eyes!

00:03:38.552 --> 00:03:40.486
God's form...!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.129
You've remembered?

00:03:52.466 --> 00:03:56.903
If that was God,
then he's terrifying.

00:04:17.391 --> 00:04:19.951
That...
That beast must be...!

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.464
Dear Lord...!

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:38.376
<i>I...</i>
I don't understand.

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:40.970
It may already
be too late.

00:04:41.815 --> 00:04:48.312
Forgive us our corruption and
guide us to the light of hope!

00:04:49.423 --> 00:04:54.418
Master, where is the
other one who was with me'?

00:04:55.529 --> 00:04:58.430
He must have been in
the same place I was.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.925
No, there was no one.

00:05:02.035 --> 00:05:04.663
No...
That can't be true!

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:08.073
I swear.
When Rocco came in here...

00:05:08.175 --> 00:05:11.270
...he found only you,
unconscious.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:19.612
Ryu...
Where can you be?

00:05:40.574 --> 00:05:43.066
To all citizens
of Ark de Grande:

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:45.804
All participants in the
Founder's Day parade...

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:48.813
...please file your program
schedule as soon as possible.

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:52.078
In accordance with the Special
Public Safety precautions...

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.950
...for the event, all those
within the city limits must...

00:05:55.055 --> 00:05:58.150
...carry registration cards in
addition to their normal ID.

00:06:08.034 --> 00:06:10.298
What's with you people?!

00:06:10.804 --> 00:06:14.536
Letting this happen
with the parade so close!

00:06:15.075 --> 00:06:17.043
I want street
patrols doubled!

00:06:17.577 --> 00:06:19.841
Bring in anyone who looks
the least bit suspicious!

00:06:20.914 --> 00:06:24.043
Those terrorists don't get a
moment's peace from here on!

00:06:24.151 --> 00:06:25.277
Understand?!

00:06:25.919 --> 00:06:29.150
All those moving between
South Area and North Area...

00:06:29.256 --> 00:06:31.816
...are to check in with
peace officer teams.

00:06:31.925 --> 00:06:36.158
We request the cooperation and
understanding of our citizens.

00:06:36.263 --> 00:06:39.824
All those moving between
South Area and North Area...

00:06:39.933 --> 00:06:42.834
How... How did
I end up here?

00:06:42.936 --> 00:06:44.802
- You there!
- Come along quietly!

00:06:44.905 --> 00:06:46.566
<i>Dammit, lemme go!</i>

00:06:50.944 --> 00:06:52.571
Outta <i>my</i> way!

00:07:03.056 --> 00:07:06.117
Sorry to trouble
you with this, Chief.

00:07:06.226 --> 00:07:09.526
Forget it.
It's part of the job.

00:07:10.463 --> 00:07:12.192
Can you get "P?

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:14.525
Hey!

00:07:29.683 --> 00:07:31.173
Mel...

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:32.149
What's wrong?

00:07:32.986 --> 00:07:36.183
Mel!
You have to find Mel!

00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:41.556
She's down in the
lower sectors. Please!

00:07:46.099 --> 00:07:48.193
Hey! What's the problem here?

00:07:53.874 --> 00:07:55.842
You...

00:07:58.445 --> 00:08:02.609
When good luck comes,
it comes in a flood.

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:05.844
Who'd have thought
you'd survive?

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:09.946
Chief!
He had this on him.

00:08:11.224 --> 00:08:15.422
It's the same as the detonator
used in the bombing yesterday.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:20.698
I see... So, you're mixed up
with the rebels too, huh?

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:25.034
You poor,
unlucky son of a bitch.

00:08:25.138 --> 00:08:28.802
If you'd just stayed underground
we'd never have found you.

00:08:28.909 --> 00:08:30.172
I don't know...

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:33.979
I don't know
anything about them!

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:41.212
Is it you again?

00:08:42.689 --> 00:08:44.714
Diana?

00:08:45.292 --> 00:08:51.129
Now you're “it“.
Try and catch me!

00:08:51.231 --> 00:08:52.892
Diana, wait!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:58.565
Why did you call me'?
Why did you bring me here?

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:01.574
Big sister...

00:09:02.409 --> 00:09:05.504
You don't like me'?

00:09:06.947 --> 00:09:09.473
You don't like
to play with me'?

00:09:11.518 --> 00:09:15.352
No. It's just that there's
someone very special to me.

00:09:16.423 --> 00:09:21.657
I can't stand worrying
about where he might be.

00:09:25.165 --> 00:09:28.328
Diana...
Try to understand!

00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:35.875
<i>HQ]...</i>

00:09:36.977 --> 00:09:38.308
Get up!

00:09:42.282 --> 00:09:46.480
So, you remember me.

00:09:46.586 --> 00:09:49.817
I'll bet you were
one of their men!

00:09:49.923 --> 00:09:53.484
I'll teach you to
screw around with me!

00:09:53.994 --> 00:09:58.295
I'll take my compensation
out of your hide!

00:10:06.539 --> 00:10:08.200
Mel!

00:10:08.308 --> 00:10:09.901
What's going on?

00:10:11.511 --> 00:10:13.070
Where...?

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.010
A monster!

00:10:21.888 --> 00:10:25.449
No...
Some sorta statue.

00:10:25.558 --> 00:10:28.584
Anyway, I'd better
get her to a doctor.

00:10:32.599 --> 00:10:33.760
Who are...?

00:10:35.135 --> 00:10:38.537
Where are
you taking me'?

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:42.006
What?
To the center of the city?

00:10:43.243 --> 00:10:47.077
Do you live up
on the surface?

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.977
I'm not from around here.

00:10:50.083 --> 00:10:53.485
I come from a town a lot
smaller than this place.

00:10:54.187 --> 00:10:57.122
I just came to
get her sight back.

00:10:57.223 --> 00:10:59.624
We were going to
leave after that.

00:11:01.461 --> 00:11:05.227
Hey!
Where'd you g0?!

00:11:10.804 --> 00:11:13.398
Is that the light
from the surface?

00:11:14.607 --> 00:11:17.338
It's so bright...

00:11:23.183 --> 00:11:25.515
Forget it.
No reaction at all.

00:11:25.952 --> 00:11:28.216
Alive, but just barely, eh?

00:11:31.257 --> 00:11:35.854
Oh well, we got what
we wanted from him.

00:11:35.962 --> 00:11:38.659
Just wait.
You won't be lonely.

00:11:38.965 --> 00:11:42.902
I'll bring your girl and
your friends up here to you.

00:11:46.906 --> 00:11:50.536
The church is
the rebels' base?

00:11:50.643 --> 00:11:56.605
Exactly. And I think the girl
with him is hiding there, too.

00:11:58.017 --> 00:12:03.148
The slums could become their
main base unless we move fast.

00:12:04.924 --> 00:12:09.555
Would it not be wise to
hit them as soon as possible?

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:13.795
All right then...
Don't tell the mayor.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.664
I'll take full
responsibility for this.

00:12:17.971 --> 00:12:20.065
We're raiding the
underground church!

00:12:20.907 --> 00:12:23.274
We'll take out those
rebels with one shot!

00:12:27.881 --> 00:12:30.077
Lovely smell...

00:12:30.183 --> 00:12:33.710
There were lots of these
flowers in my hometown.

00:12:34.521 --> 00:12:38.924
But, Miss Mel...
Don't you come from Heaven?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:45.454
Is that what they told you?
Well, it's not true.

00:12:46.199 --> 00:12:48.600
I really come from--

00:12:51.638 --> 00:12:53.197
Miss Mel,
what's wrong?

00:12:53.306 --> 00:12:54.933
Miss Mel?!

00:13:00.313 --> 00:13:01.678
Somebody help!

00:13:02.081 --> 00:13:03.571
Miss Mel's...!

00:13:08.488 --> 00:13:10.650
If I could just hide
it a little longer...

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:16.228
Miss Mel!

00:13:16.529 --> 00:13:18.497
Has God spoken
to you again?

00:13:18.598 --> 00:13:22.159
Stay out! Please!

00:13:22.268 --> 00:13:23.531
Miss Mel...

00:13:23.636 --> 00:13:26.401
Get out!
Leave me alone!

00:13:27.607 --> 00:13:29.837
Has He been angered?!

00:13:29.943 --> 00:13:34.574
I'm not God's messenger!
I can't take this anymore!

00:13:38.585 --> 00:13:40.849
She's been possessed
by the Devil.

00:13:45.124 --> 00:13:49.584
Where are you?
Why haven't you come back?

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:54.592
I'm carrying
your child, Ryu!

00:14:00.306 --> 00:14:02.536
- What the...!
- Look at that!

00:14:32.905 --> 00:14:35.169
Listen up, slum rats!

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:39.869
You are to vacate this
area for a refugee camp!

00:14:40.947 --> 00:14:44.850
Anyone who resists us
will be removed forcibly.

00:14:45.418 --> 00:14:46.715
You're kidding!

00:14:46.819 --> 00:14:48.753
- This is nuts!
- Are you serious?!

00:14:48.855 --> 00:14:54.692
Additionally! You've a girl here
with strange powers, don't you?

00:14:54.794 --> 00:14:56.728
Hand her over to me!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.427
What?

00:14:58.531 --> 00:15:00.329
What's he talking about?

00:15:00.433 --> 00:15:04.961
Yes, I see!
You're the ones!

00:15:05.071 --> 00:15:08.666
You're devils! The ones
who possess Miss Mel!

00:15:09.475 --> 00:15:14.413
Defiled beasts!
This is a holy congregation!

00:15:15.048 --> 00:15:17.039
No place for
the likes of you!

00:15:19.085 --> 00:15:21.816
Accursed demons...
Begone!

00:15:23.523 --> 00:15:25.013
Wait!

00:15:26.025 --> 00:15:28.050
Miss Mel! Stay back!

00:15:30.096 --> 00:15:32.758
So, you're that
guy's girlfriend?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:39.871
Ryu... You're talking
about Ryu, aren't you?

00:15:39.972 --> 00:15:41.963
If you know where he is,
then take me to him!

00:15:42.675 --> 00:15:44.666
Where is he?

00:15:46.012 --> 00:15:48.947
Very well.
I'll let you join him.

00:15:49.048 --> 00:15:51.107
Your dear man...IS IN HELL!

00:15:59.459 --> 00:16:02.019
Miss...Mel...

00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:08.500
Oh Lord...

00:16:10.703 --> 00:16:12.694
Deliver us...

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:41.330
Beloved citizens of
Ark de Grande City!

00:16:41.434 --> 00:16:44.768
I am your mayor,
Grimson Rockwell!

00:16:45.705 --> 00:16:49.335
Today we celebrate the 50th
anniversary of our city's founding.

00:16:49.442 --> 00:16:52.878
And as its mayor,
I wish to thank all of you...

00:16:52.979 --> 00:16:56.415
...who love and work to
build this metropolis.

00:16:58.117 --> 00:17:01.314
It began as a seed,
sown in the earth...

00:17:01.421 --> 00:17:04.652
...of the ruins of
humanity's history.

00:17:04.757 --> 00:17:08.523
The great founders of this
city set out to let...

00:17:08.628 --> 00:17:12.292
...civilization grow again,
not knowing if the same...

00:17:12.398 --> 00:17:15.390
...mistakes would be
repeated once more.

00:17:15.668 --> 00:17:19.161
But their wishes
have borne fruit!

00:17:19.272 --> 00:17:23.368
And their seed has grown
into a magnificent blossom!

00:17:25.111 --> 00:17:28.342
Thank you!
Thank you all!

00:17:29.749 --> 00:17:33.310
And finally, my friends,
you labor for this city...

00:17:33.419 --> 00:17:36.514
You myriad exalted souls
who made it possible...

00:17:36.622 --> 00:17:42.026
...give a prayer of thanks and
appreciation for our fair city!

00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:53.364
Glory to Ark de Grande!

00:18:06.953 --> 00:18:07.977
Diana...

00:18:16.896 --> 00:18:18.125
Elaine, no!

00:18:19.065 --> 00:18:23.559
Stop it! She's different!

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.842
It's going to happen
again, isn't it?

00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:36.938
You're going to
become that monster.

00:18:41.921 --> 00:18:46.483
Don't you understand?!
Our power...

00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:49.994
Our power has no
place in this world...

00:18:50.096 --> 00:18:52.360
Diana...

00:18:52.465 --> 00:18:54.024
Big sister?

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:57.899
Diana... Am I dead?

00:18:58.004 --> 00:18:58.835
No! Please!

00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:03.466
Don't ask for the power!
It guides the monster!

00:19:04.544 --> 00:19:09.812
The life I carry inside me
will never be born...

00:19:09.916 --> 00:19:12.010
Big sister...!

00:19:12.385 --> 00:19:16.344
This city...
I want this city destroyed!

00:20:03.102 --> 00:20:05.070
What's happening?!

00:20:26.792 --> 00:20:28.692
Bring out all the weapons
we can to fight it!

00:20:29.061 --> 00:20:33.362
Anyone can help! Whoever kills
it gets elite citizenship!

00:21:16.442 --> 00:21:17.910
No, please...!

00:21:29.622 --> 00:21:32.091
Ryu... Ryu...

00:22:37.456 --> 00:22:40.517
You will not die.

00:23:13.926 --> 00:23:17.521
I, Genichiro Kuryu,
leader of the Kuryu group...

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.496
...give you this order!

00:23:19.598 --> 00:23:22.363
Destroy the target!

00:23:22.601 --> 00:23:26.834
I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:26.939 --> 00:23:30.500
I, Genichiro Kuryu,
leader of the Kuryu group...

00:23:30.609 --> 00:23:32.338
...give you this order!

00:23:32.444 --> 00:23:35.038
Destroy the target!

00:23:35.147 --> 00:23:35.624
I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:35.648 --> 00:23:37.526
Elaine... I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:39.227
I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:39.251 --> 00:23:39.594
Diana... I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:39.618 --> 00:23:40.862
Diana... I, Genichiro Kuryu,
leader of the Kuryu Group...

00:23:40.886 --> 00:23:43.048
I, Genichiro Kuryu,
leader of the Kuryu group...

00:23:43.155 --> 00:23:45.123
...give you this order!

00:23:45.224 --> 00:23:47.818
Destroy the target!

00:23:47.927 --> 00:23:52.524
I say again,
destroy the target!

00:23:52.631 --> 00:23:57.364
I, Genichi-- --uryu,
--eader of th-- --yu gro--

00:24:29.501 --> 00:24:32.232
Big sister...
